        <activityName xml:lang="en">Door, outer, aluminium, transparent filling, total</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Door, outer, aluminium, transparent filling, total
The measures of the visible door sheet are 1.0m x 2.0m. The bill of materials is based on data from 4 aluminium system houses. The disposal was estimated based on the bill of materials.;
UUID: 81552f5b-560c-35be-91ff-9366bb3543c0
Included are the supply of outer aluminium doors with transparent filling at regional storage and the disposal at the end of life.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Bill of materials. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_81552f5b-560c-35be-91ff-9366bb3543c0.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
